            <div className="p-12">
              <div className="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
                <div className="p-3 bg-indigo-600 rounded-2xl">
                  <Rocket className="w-8 h-8 text-white" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h2 className="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">Chào mừng đến với Forge OS 2025</h2>
                  <p className="text-slate-400 font-medium">Hệ thống tự động hóa nâng cấp Website bằng trí tuệ nhân tạo.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10">
                <div className="p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-colors group">
                  <div className="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <MousePointer2 className="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" />
                  </div>
                  <h4 className="font-bold text-white mb-2 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">1. Dán Code Cũ</h4>
                  <p className="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Dán mã HTML/CSS/JS lạc hậu, thô sơ từ những năm 2000-2015 vào khung bên trái.</p>
                </div>
                <div className="p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors group">
                  <div className="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <Zap className="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" />
